+      <div>
+        <h1>Minecraft Java that stays light on your phone</h1>
+        <p class="lead">AmberLauncher is a Minecraft Java Edition launcher for Android. Its defaults adapt to your phone's RAM, and mods from Modrinth and CurseForge install right from the app.</p>
+        <div class="dl panel" id="unduh">
+          <a class="btn-dl" id="dl-main" href="https://github.com/ItsVynzzzz/AmberLauncher/releases">
