+            <span class="t"><span class="l1">Download from GitHub</span><span class="l2">Looking for the latest version…</span></span>
+          </a>
+          <div class="row">
+            <a data-dl="32" data-hide-missing href="https://github.com/ItsVynzzzz/AmberLauncher/releases" hidden>Older phones (32-bit)</a>
+            <a href="https://github.com/ItsVynzzzz/AmberLauncher/releases">All releases</a>
+            <a href="#keaslian">Verify the APK</a>
+          </div>
+          <p class="status" id="dl-status" role="status"></p>
+          <p class="note">Needs Android 8.0 or newer and 3 GB of RAM or more (4 GB is more comfortable). Still in beta, so your feedback means a lot.</p>
