+  <section class="sec" id="mulai">
+    <div class="wrap sec-grid">
+      <div><h2>Getting started</h2><p class="intro">From installing to joining a world.</p></div>
+      <div class="sec-body"><ol class="steps"><li><div><b>Open AmberLauncher.</b> On Android 11 and newer, allow storage access so data is kept in the <code>nuxlauncher</code> folder. You can skip it; data then stays in the app's private folder.</div></li><li><div><b>Add an account</b> under <b>Accounts</b>: Microsoft to play online, or offline to play on your own.</div></li><li><div><b>Create an instance</b> with <b>Create Instance</b>: choose a Minecraft version, then Vanilla, Fabric, Forge, or NeoForge.</div></li><li><div>On <b>Home</b>, press <b>DOWNLOAD</b> and wait for it to finish (internet required), then press <b>PLAY</b>.</div></li><li><div>Install mods, resource packs, and shaders from the <b>Mods</b> menu.</div></li></ol></div>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="sec" id="fitur">
+    <div class="wrap sec-grid">
+      <div><h2>Features</h2><p class="intro">A small set of settings, with the important ones in place.</p></div>
+      <div class="sec-body">
+        <div class="group"><h3>Game</h3><ul><li><b>Many separate instances,</b> <span>each with its own version, mods, and settings.</span></li><li><b>Vanilla, Fabric, Forge (1.13+), and NeoForge (1.20.2+).</b> <span>Mod and modpack search automatically matches the instance's loader.</span></li><li><b>Bundled Java:</b> <span>Java 8, 17, 21, and 25, with nothing else to install.</span></li><li><b>Renderer choices:</b> <span>Auto (recommended), Krypton, MobileGlues, GL4ES, Kopper Zink, and Freedreno (Snapdragon Turnip).</span></li></ul></div><div class="group"><h3>Mods and content</h3><ul><li><b>Modrinth and CurseForge</b> <span>right inside the app: mods, modpacks, resource packs, shaders, and datapacks, including their dependencies. Manual file installation works too.</span></li></ul></div><div class="group"><h3>Controls</h3><ul><li><b>Touch control editor:</b> <span>adjust the position, size, and buttons on screen however you like.</span></li><li><b>Bedrock-style touch hotbar:</b> <span>tap the hotbar to select a slot, also with a second finger while the camera is being dragged.</span></li><li><b>Controller (gamepad) support,</b> <span>including mods such as Controlify.</span></li><li><b>Joystick auto-sprint</b> <span>can be turned off, and on-screen Shift/Ctrl/Alt buttons are sent as modifiers.</span></li></ul></div><div class="group"><h3>More</h3><ul><li><b>Accounts:</b> <span>Microsoft, Ely.by, and offline.</span></li><li><b>Built-in screen recording:</b> <span>choose Game only or With buttons. It uses the hardware encoder and saves to the Gallery. Game audio is not recorded yet.</span></li><li><b>Crash reports</b> <span>with optional log upload to mclo.gs.</span></li><li><b>In-app updates,</b> <span>with the 32-bit or 64-bit APK chosen automatically.</span></li><li><b>Multilingual interface:</b> <span>Bahasa Indonesia, English, Español, and Tiếng Việt.</span></li></ul></div>
+        <p class="muted">Not supported yet: Forge for Minecraft 1.12.2 and older, NeoForge for 1.20.1 and older, and Quilt.</p>
+      </div>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="sec" id="apk">
+    <div class="wrap sec-grid">
+      <div><h2>Choose an APK</h2><p class="intro">If unsure, take the 64-bit one.</p></div>
+      <div class="sec-body">
+        <div class="apks panel">
+          <div class="apk">
+            <div><h3>64-bit (arm64-v8a)</h3><span class="tag">The default choice</span><p>Almost every phone made in the last several years.</p></div>
+            <a class="btn" data-dl="64" href="https://github.com/ItsVynzzzz/AmberLauncher/releases">Download 64-bit</a>
+          </div>
+          <div class="apk">
+            <div><h3>32-bit (armeabi-v7a)</h3><span class="tag">Old phones only</span><p>For old phones with a 32-bit CPU. Game RAM is capped at about 1.2 GB and some renderers are unavailable. Not present in every release.</p></div>
+            <a class="btn" data-dl="32" href="https://github.com/ItsVynzzzz/AmberLauncher/releases">Download 32-bit</a>
+          </div>
+        </div>
+        <p class="note-p">The first time you install, Android may ask you to allow installing apps from your browser or file manager. After that, updates can be installed from inside the launcher (Settings &gt; Updates).</p>
+      </div>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="sec" id="keaslian">
+    <div class="wrap sec-grid">
+      <div><h2>Verify the APK</h2><p class="intro">For anyone who downloaded it elsewhere.</p></div>
+      <div class="sec-body stack">
+        <p>Every official APK is signed with the same key. Compare the APK's certificate fingerprint with the one below before installing.</p>
+        <div>
+          <span class="label">Certificate fingerprint (SHA-256)</span>
+          <div class="hash"><span class="mono" id="fp">B2:29:4B:4E:2B:5E:65:0C:7C:43:B2:30:1F:35:9B:2C:17:83:C4:0C:82:DF:10:D8:F5:69:D0:56:A1:7B:5E:3F</span><button class="btn" type="button" data-copy="fp">Copy</button></div>
+        </div>
+        <div>
+          <span class="label">How to check (apksigner tool from the Android SDK)</span>
+          <div class="cmd mono">apksigner verify --print-certs AmberLauncher-&lt;version&gt;-64bit-arm64-v8a.apk</div>
+        </div>
+        <p class="muted">App ID: <span class="mono">com.itsvynzzzz.amberlauncher</span><br>How to report a security vulnerability is in <a href="https://github.com/ItsVynzzzz/AmberLauncher/blob/main/SECURITY.md">SECURITY.md</a> (Indonesian).</p>
+      </div>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="sec" id="bantuan">
+    <div class="wrap sec-grid">
+      <div><h2>Help</h2><p class="intro">The problems that come up most.</p></div>
+      <div class="sec-body"><ul class="faq"><li><b>The game closes by itself or crashes.</b> <span>Give the game no more than about half of your phone's RAM, close other apps, or lower the resolution ratio in Settings. Crash reports can be viewed inside the app.</span></li><li><b>Low FPS.</b> <span>Lower the render distance, lower the resolution ratio, or try another renderer in Settings.</span></li><li><b>A mod does not work.</b> <span>Make sure the instance's loader and Minecraft version match what the mod requires.</span></li><li><b>Found a bug?</b> <span>Open an <a href="https://github.com/ItsVynzzzz/AmberLauncher/issues">issue</a> with the AmberLauncher version, your phone model and Android version, the steps that cause the problem, and the log. Logs shared from the launcher are scrubbed of tokens and passwords.</span></li></ul></div>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+
+  <section class="sec" id="privasi">
+    <div class="wrap sec-grid">
+      <div><h2>Privacy and security</h2><p class="intro">What the launcher does with your account.</p></div>
+      <div class="sec-body"><ul class="faq"><li><b>Microsoft passwords are never stored.</b> <span>Sign-in uses Microsoft's official OAuth window.</span></li><li><b>Minecraft assets and libraries</b> <span>are downloaded straight from Mojang's official servers and checked against their official SHA-1 fingerprints.</span></li><li><b>All internet connections</b> <span>use HTTPS.</span></li></ul></div>
+    </div>
+  </section>
+</main>
+
+<footer class="foot">
+  <div class="wrap">
+    <div class="links"><a href="https://github.com/ItsVynzzzz/AmberLauncher">GitHub</a><a href="https://github.com/ItsVynzzzz/AmberLauncher/releases">Releases</a><a href="https://github.com/ItsVynzzzz/AmberLauncher/issues">Issues</a><a href="https://github.com/ItsVynzzzz/AmberLauncher/blob/main/LICENSE">GPL v3 license</a></div>
+    <p>AmberLauncher is an independent project and is not affiliated with Mojang Studios, Microsoft, or the third-party projects mentioned below. Minecraft is a trademark of Mojang AB / Microsoft Corporation. AmberLauncher does not include or distribute a copy of the game; to play online you need a valid Minecraft Java Edition account.</p>
