+      </table></div>
+    </details>
+    <p>AmberLauncher is released under the GNU General Public License v3.0. Copyright © 2026 ItsVynzzzz for changes and new code; code from the upstream projects remains the property of its respective authors. AmberLauncher is a fork of NUX Launcher, which is based on Zalith Launcher 2 and PojavLauncher. In line with Zalith Launcher 2's additional terms, the names “ZalithLauncher” and “ZL” are not used, and the Unofficial Modified Version notice and copyright notices remain visible in the app.</p>
